{
  "esm": "0.8.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "duo_arc_length",
    "description": "Great-circle (geodesic) distance between two points a=(ax,ay,az) and b=(bx,by,bz) on a sphere of radius `radius`: duo_arc_length = radius * acos( (a.b) / (|a| |b|) ). Scalar stencil atom (Chen 2021, great-circle length used throughout Appendix B, Eqs B6-B7). The duo spatial-operator rules bind it inline on the halo-extended cartesian node array (grid.esm duo_node_cart) to obtain physical cell-face lengths: the x-normal face on the WEST side of cell (t,i,j) is the arc from node(t,i,j) to node(t,i,j+1); the y-normal face on the SOUTH side is the arc from node(t,i,j) to node(t,i+1,j). East face of cell i equals West face of cell i+1 (single-valued), so the flux-divergence is discretely conservative. This face length is the 'Delta y'/'Delta x' multiplying the LMARS normal velocity in the continuity flux (Eqs 4-5), the coordinate-line edge weight in the relative vorticity (Eq 9 / C38), and the pressure-force lever in the momentum update (Eqs 7-8). AXIS-NEUTRAL: swap the node pair to measure any face on either grid direction.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:duo",
      "op:arc_length"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X. (2021). The LMARS based shallow-water dynamical core on generic gnomonic cubed sphere geometry. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 13(1), e2020MS002280.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2020MS002280"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "duo_arc_length": {
      "params": [
        "ax",
        "ay",
        "az",
        "bx",
        "by",
        "bz",
        "radius"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          "radius",
          {
            "op": "acos",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "min",
                "args": [
                  1.0,
                  {
                    "op": "max",
                    "args": [
                      -1.0,
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "+",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  "ax",
                                  "bx"
                                ]
                              },
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  "ay",
                                  "by"
                                ]
                              },
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  "az",
                                  "bz"
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "sqrt",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "+",
                                    "args": [
                                      {
                                        "op": "*",
                                        "args": [
                                          "ax",
                                          "ax"
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "op": "*",
                                        "args": [
                                          "ay",
                                          "ay"
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "op": "*",
                                        "args": [
                                          "az",
                                          "az"
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
                              {
                                "op": "sqrt",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "+",
                                    "args": [
                                      {
                                        "op": "*",
                                        "args": [
                                          "bx",
                                          "bx"
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "op": "*",
                                        "args": [
                                          "by",
                                          "by"
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "op": "*",
                                        "args": [
                                          "bz",
                                          "bz"
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
